  'noc.bannerNoGroupsCta':  'Set up groups',
  // Help texts — three lines: what it does / benefit / recommended (settings-help-coverage)
  'help.noc.groups':           'What it does: Defines the 24/7 monitoring team’s e-mail lists; when an alert opens, the groups the monitor uses (or the default groups) get the e-mail.\nBenefit: Even when the team is asleep overnight or at the weekend, the 24/7 team finds out and phones the team responsible.\nRecommended: At least one active default group; keep the addresses up to date as the rota changes.',
  'help.noc.groupEmails':      'What it does: The addresses in the group (1–50); the 24/7 e-mail goes to all of them.\nBenefit: You can paste a whole list in one go; invalid and duplicate addresses are caught before you save.\nRecommended: The 24/7 desk’s shared mailbox (e.g. noc@example.com), plus the shift lead if needed.',
  'help.noc.groupActive':      'What it does: Controls whether the group receives e-mails.\nBenefit: You can take a group out of service temporarily without deleting it; monitors keep their group choice.\nRecommended: On; only switch it off during maintenance or a team change.',
  'help.noc.groupDefault':     'What it does: Marks the group that receives 24/7 e-mails from monitors that don’t pick a specific group.\nBenefit: No need to pick a group on every monitor, and new monitors are covered automatically.\nRecommended: Make the 24/7 desk’s main list the default; you can have more than one default group.',
  'help.noc.enabledTypes':     'What it does: Switches 24/7 notifications on or off for a whole monitor type.\nBenefit: You can keep a noisy type (e.g. Ping) away from the 24/7 team without touching each monitor.\nRecommended: All on; switch a type off temporarily if it causes needless calls.',
  'help.noc.minLevel':         'What it does: Sets the lowest alert level that reaches the 24/7 team.\nBenefit: Night-time calls are made only for alerts that genuinely need action, so nobody is woken up needlessly.\nRecommended: Critical only (the default).',
  'help.noc.sendResolve':      'What it does: Sends the 24/7 team a "RESOLVED" e-mail when the alert clears (if the opening e-mail went to them).\nBenefit: The 24/7 team knows the problem is over, so there are no needless calls or follow-ups.\nRecommended: On.',
  'help.noc.callInstructions': 'What it does: Call instructions shown in the 24/7 e-mail (plain text, up to 1,000 characters).\nBenefit: The 24/7 team reads in the e-mail itself whom to call, in what order and how long to wait.\nRecommended: Short and step by step: the first person on the call list, then the next if there’s no answer, then the team manager.',
  'userpush.title': 'Per-User Webhook Notifications',
  'userpush.groupDesc.yonetici': 'Team managers — only HIGH and CRITICAL alerts are delivered.',
  'userpush.groupDesc.uzman': 'Team experts — alerts of every level are delivered.',
  'userpush.groupDesc.po': 'Product owners (PO role) — alerts of every level are delivered.',
  'userpush.groupDesc.bolum_baskani': 'Department heads — by default only CRITICAL alerts are delivered.',
  'userpush.groupDesc.clevel': 'C-Level executives — by default only CRITICAL alerts are delivered.',
