  'tour.s.favorites.title': 'Favourites',
  'tour.s.favorites.body': 'Use the star on a monitor card to add it to your favourites. They appear here in the "Favourites" quick view and at the top of quick search (Ctrl K); they are saved to your account, so they are the same on every device.',
  'tour.s.saved-views.title': 'Views',
  'tour.s.saved-views.body': 'Save a list\'s filters, sort order and search under a name, then return to it in one click from the "Views" menu. You\'ll find it on the monitoring pages, the Monitoring Overview, Alert History and Incident & Error History.',
  'tour.s.status-page.title': 'Status page',
  'tour.s.status-page.body': 'The live status of services, open incidents and planned maintenance at a glance — a short summary for everyone outside the operations teams.',
  'tour.s.alert-history.title': 'Alert History',
  'tour.s.alert-history.body': 'Open and closed alerts in one list, with each alert\'s timeline and the notifications that were sent. Narrow it down with filters, search and saved views; the count badges in the menu open that type\'s open alerts here.',
  'tour.s.shortcuts.title': 'Keyboard shortcuts',
  'tour.s.shortcuts.body': 'Press ? to list every shortcut. G then D goes to the Dashboard, G then M to the Monitoring Overview, and / jumps to the page\'s search box. Shortcuts are paused while you are typing in a field.',
